<title>POLAND: INDYKPOL TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 20.</title>
<headline>INDYKPOL TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 70,000 shares in poultry producer Indykpol SA at 20 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular bourse session Indykpol traded at 18.6 zlotys in a volume of 1,605 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
